{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01021",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 2.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Welcome. Make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.58,
      "end_seconds": 7.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Hello, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.73,
      "end_seconds": 13.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.09,
      "end_seconds": 20.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.02,
      "end_seconds": 32.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.38,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a burn on my left forearm. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.54,
      "end_seconds": 36.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.03,
      "end_seconds": 39.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I'd say a week, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 40.49,
      "end_seconds": 45.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Hm, you know, I'd say more like two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.09,
      "end_seconds": 51.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly one to two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.47,
      "end_seconds": 56.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I mean, uh, that sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.5,
      "end_seconds": 72.74,
      "duration_seconds": 14.24,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.77,
      "end_seconds": 86.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.68,
      "text": "I get some relief from cool water. I notice it more with touching it and clothes. Oh, and being worried about scarring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.68,
      "end_seconds": 87.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.36,
      "end_seconds": 94.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Oh, and a stinging pain. Had that since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.68,
      "end_seconds": 98.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Did you notice any numbness at the burn?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.37,
      "end_seconds": 106.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Well, uh, no, I haven't had any numbness at the burn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.43,
      "end_seconds": 112.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "And what about trouble breathing, chemical exposure or burn on the face?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.82,
      "end_seconds": 121.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "I haven't had trouble breathing, chemical exposure or burn on the face, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.52,
      "end_seconds": 125.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.71,
      "end_seconds": 130.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Nothing there, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.29,
      "end_seconds": 135.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.12,
      "end_seconds": 139.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Erm, no, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.09,
      "end_seconds": 143.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.87,
      "end_seconds": 148.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.1,
      "end_seconds": 154.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.31,
      "end_seconds": 169.05,
      "duration_seconds": 12.74,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I gave up cigarettes last spring. I live with my elderly mother. I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.86,
      "end_seconds": 188.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.51,
      "end_seconds": 202.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.84,
      "text": "Just a triple bypass, eight years ago. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.07,
      "end_seconds": 205.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 206.59,
      "end_seconds": 211.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "It's, It's sitagliptin, 100 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.68,
      "end_seconds": 220.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.18,
      "end_seconds": 230.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "I have heart disease. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. Diabetes, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.89,
      "end_seconds": 237.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.13,
      "end_seconds": 258.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.93,
      "end_seconds": 269.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Right, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.84,
      "end_seconds": 284.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 66, blood pressure 117 over 71, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.21,
      "end_seconds": 288.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Yeah, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.05,
      "end_seconds": 292.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.85,
      "end_seconds": 298.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.15,
      "end_seconds": 301.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.4,
      "end_seconds": 325.09,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "There is a five-centimetre area of redness with an intact blister on the left forearm, and it blanches and is painful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.1,
      "end_seconds": 328.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.75,
      "end_seconds": 335.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "So, thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.08,
      "end_seconds": 362.18,
      "duration_seconds": 12.1,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, I think we're dealing with a superficial partial-thickness burn at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.31,
      "end_seconds": 367.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Mm, what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.05,
      "end_seconds": 394.21,
      "duration_seconds": 26.16,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a superficial partial-thickness burn. We'll begin with paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. That should help with burn pain. Cool the area under running water for twenty minutes and cover it with a non-stick dressing, and leave the blister alone. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.97,
      "end_seconds": 399.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Mm, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.21,
      "end_seconds": 402.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}